WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:24.727 --> 00:00:29.927
Hey, these nights are fashioned around you.

00:00:35.711 --> 00:00:42.127
I guess a better path of love is no longer haunting you.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:54.327
Come spring anew and my heart's still blue.

00:01:03.361 --> 00:01:09.761
I've been sitting around. Waiting for you to perform.

00:01:09.761 --> 00:01:14.207
Sing a song with me because I'm bored.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:19.873
You bore me, you bore me, you bore me, you do.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:25.230
You make me want to run away from you.

00:01:26.066 --> 00:01:33.586
Come spring anew and my heart's still blue.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:40.900
These days hold me as I dwell in my love for you.

00:01:47.844 --> 00:01:50.527
So blue.

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:02.145
So blue.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:28.070
Tonight, I can see something of who I am.

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:41.687
My ear is listening. I'm here in this room, here are my dreams today.

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:48.910
Behind every shadow is something of mine.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.750
And I think they're like me.

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:57.110
They bear my name.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.500
And they emerge.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:07.700
They emerge from things like mirrors.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:13.660
I want to live as I've never lived.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:22.140
A life with God, I'll be there.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:30.100
I want to live as I've never lived.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:39.300
You and I. Something beyond. Something beyond love.

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:43.950
I'll be there.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:15.570
Years passed and that wild guy I used to be,
stayed behind somewhere on the road.

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:26.890
I never had money,
just air blowing in my pocket.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:36.970
I never knew fear. Only sand,
only sorrow.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:48.170
Year after year, my body grew, and my mind suddenly woke up.

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:59.170
Between flowers of war and the poison of pleasure, all is well.

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:06.076
All is well.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:57.050
From my house and my barracks.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:03.600
Nobody knows how I live. Nobody knows my role.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:13.600
While I paint the walls the color of a sunrise, all is going well.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:19.113
All is well.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:30.100
In the desert, I thought I would die of thirst.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:41.850
They gave me something to drink from an animal pregnant with light.

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:52.067
Sand and light, sperm and the smell of youth.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:10:04.007
A reflection of dreams immersed me in its expanse.

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:07.170
Tongues of the sun.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:16.777
To drink pleasure in gulps,
to feel the mouth of fear.

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:24.970
Sand and scorpion, searching for an impossible dream.

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:29.890
Underneath the kiss of night.

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:33.010
Tongues of the sun.

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:40.770
Oasis of love. Poets in Eden.

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:46.890
Finally, I find you in the fire.

00:10:48.913 --> 00:10:52.090
I kiss fire and I don't burn.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:20.080
Traveling around the world, I walk and I walk.

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:25.360
I ask the chimera about the mystery of fate.

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:30.520
Nomad, crazy, night owl and dreamer.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:36.160
A vagabond. A throne without a king.

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:41.280
A vagabond. A temple without God.

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:45.760
A vagabond. A throne without a king.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:50.960
A vagabond. A temple without God.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:29.920
The chimera.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:47.100
Throne without a king. A vagabond, temple without a God.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:56.143
A vagabond, a throne without a king. A vagabond, a temple without a God.

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:00.880
Great.

